{"t": 1794120061.2916858, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in checkout/promo.py: normalize_code() now strips surrounding whitespace, removes all inner whitespace, and upper-cases the code before lookup.\n\nRoot cause confirmed in production: Sentry CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q - PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist (2,940 events, Android 15 / app 8.2). Android keyboards insert surrounding spaces and lower-case input, so the raw code missed the lookup.\n\nVerification: normalize_code(' autumn24 ') -> 'AUTUMN24'; normalize_code('SPRING 24') -> 'SPRING24'; normalize_code('summer24') -> 'SUMMER24'.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
